mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Alphabet第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，Google Cloud运营利润率升至35.6%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">黑森林实验室发布FLUX3多模态模型，支持20秒音视频生成与机器人行为预测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbf511116b0653d1158ca75dacce62e6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Black Forest Labs正式推出FLUX3多模态基础模型，该模型采用统一架构，基于Self-Flow自监督流匹配框架，实现了图像、视频与音频的联合学习与同步训练。FLUX3支持单次生成最长20秒的视频并附带原生音频，具备文生视频、图生视频、视频生视频及多镜头串联等多种创作模式。在人工评测中，FLUX3在10秒720p视频生成任务中表现优异，对比Grok Imagine Video胜率达69%，对比Seedance 2.0和Gemini Omni Flash胜率均为52%。除内容生成外，FLUX3还具备图像编辑能力，并正与Mimic Robotics合作探索机器人行为预测应用，旨在将多模态AI能力从数字内容创作延伸至实体机器人领域。目前，FLUX3已通过Early Access方式上线，标志着该模型在多</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源0.8B参数文档解析模型OvisOCR2，登顶OmniDocBench基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cb30ff938973a12cf696bd77d1ded8b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式开源0.8B参数规模的文档解析模型OvisOCR2，该模型在OmniDocBench v1.6基准测试中以96.58分登顶，成为首个超越传统流水线方法的端到端文档解析模型。OvisOCR2基于Qwen3.5-0.8B后训练，通过单模型一次生成即可输出包含文本、公式、表格及视觉区域的Markdown格式，有效解决了传统“版面分析+内容识别”模式中存在的误差累积与部署复杂问题。在技术实现上，该模型结合真实与合成数据，利用SFT、RL、OPD及模型融合等手段优化性能。目前，OvisOCR2已基于Apache 2.0协议在Hugging Face及魔搭社区开源，兼容vLLM推理框架。其小参数、高效能的特性显著降低了高精度文档解析的算力门槛，推动文档智能向模型驱动的简洁范式演进，为RAG检索与企业知识库构建提</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年国际数学家大会新晋菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼（Jacob Zimmerman）正式宣布加入OpenAI，将专注于AI安全领域的研究。齐默尔曼在数学界以重塑o-极小性理论、证明格里菲斯周期图像代数性猜想及安德烈-奥尔特猜想而闻名。OpenAI首席研究官马克·陈（Mark Chen）及研究员布贝克（Bubeck）均公开确认该消息，并高度评价其顶尖数学天赋及对AI安全议题的严谨思考。齐默尔曼出生于1988年，曾两度获得IMO金牌，师从数论名家彼得·萨纳克，此前任教于多伦多大学。此次顶尖数学家跨界投身AI安全，标志着AI安全治理领域正吸引全球学术界顶尖人才，其深厚的数论与算术几何背景预计将为OpenAI在模型安全与治理架构上提供新的数学视角与理论支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f427fa5c2d92a15cc77ab1b6b6a1c035.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯于7月23日正式宣布组织架构调整，将混元多模态模型部门与大语言模型部门合并，新设基础模型部，由腾讯首席AI科学家姚顺雨统一管理。此次重组旨在打破多模态与语言模型间的研发壁垒，提升模型协同效率，通过统一的指挥中枢加速全模态模型的研发进程。姚顺雨此前已于去年12月兼任大语言模型部负责人，此次调整进一步明确了腾讯在混元技术路线上将“视觉感知”与“语言对话”能力深度融合的战略意图。通过将两条核心技术线收归同一部门，腾讯意在通过全模态架构探索大模型智能上限，优化资源配置，从而在激烈的AI模型竞争中提升技术迭代速度与产品应用协同能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Alphabet第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，Google Cloud运营利润率升至35.6%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94144b689fb240822bd21f2db8ddc42c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet发布2026年第二季度财报，资本支出同比暴涨100%至创纪录的449.2亿美元，年化支出逼近1800亿美元。核心业务Google Cloud表现强劲，营收同比增长82%达248亿美元，运营利润率从此前水平近乎翻倍至35.6%，积压订单规模达5140亿美元。在AI产品层面，Gemini月活用户已达9.5亿，模型API每分钟处理token量达220亿。谷歌通过大规模AI基建投入支撑云业务的高速增长与利润率扩张，显示出其在AI基础设施周期中的战略布局。行业分析指出，超大规模云服务商的资本支出正持续攀升，预计到2027年相关支出将突破万亿美元大关，AI数据中心建设已成为各巨头争夺的核心领域。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
